{"ID":"20240118151243-qj9yvui","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151243-qj9yvui","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151243-qj9yvui\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151243-3qm3rqr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122110547-o1rcjzr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122110547-nqmzcgm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:121,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:121\u0026#125;","title":"109木兰","type":"doc","updated":"20240130102217"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151243-3qm3rqr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151243-3qm3rqr","updated":"20240122110523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦寒，主身大热在皮肤中，去面热，赤疱酒皻zhā，恶风瘨疾，阴下痒湿，明耳目。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110527-gvhwnet","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110527-gvhwnet"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，庭院可种植。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110529-0c0ddwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110529-0c0ddwn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】木兰皮味苦，性寒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110531-os27ycw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110531-os27ycw"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】木兰皮为解热，行血，祛湿药。治面疱，酒糟鼻，水肿，酒疸，重舌，及阴下湿痒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110533-72xw6tx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110533-72xw6tx"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗中风伤寒，及痈疽，水肿，去臭气。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110534-gmrs5nm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110534-gmrs5nm"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110539-rgp6is0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110539-rgp6is0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】体寒之人禁。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110540-9v69n1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110540-9v69n1d"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【附方】面上疱——木兰皮一斤，细切酒渍百日晒干，栀子一斤，共为末，每服方寸匕，日三。（肘后）。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110545-utklojr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110545-utklojr"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"酒疸发斑——赤黑黄色，心下懊痛，足胫肿满，小便黄，由大醉当风，入水所致：木兰皮一两，黄花二两，为末，酒服方寸匕，日三。（肘后）。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110525-0mxiggg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110525-0mxiggg"}},{"ID":"20240122110547-jhalg8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110547-jhalg8z"}},{"ID":"20240122110547-nqmzcgm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110547-nqmzcgm","updated":"20240130102217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个109这是木兰，这个木兰我们是用皮，主要是皮。它的味苦，性寒。寒的药通通是……这个女孩子吃对皮肤也是很好。面皰，青春痘啊，用木兰皮可以治，诸位可以参考。这个直接服用，打粉晒干打粉都可以。一般来说，你只要记得寒味的药给体寒的人吃，体寒的人瘦瘦，下利，也不会口渴，这都是有寒症，这气色比较暗都属于寒症。"}]},{"ID":"20240122110547-o1rcjzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110547-o1rcjzr"}}]}